sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Customer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>RatingFormDialog
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>CreateRatingBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>CreateRatingController
  participant Rating as «entity»<br/>Rating
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: rate a designer, optionally for one IDP,
  UI->>B: POST /api/customer/ratings (JWT)
  B->>C: create(Integer customerId, RatingRequest request)
  alt duplicate rating or IDP of another designer
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 409 / 400 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>Rating: generalRatingExists()
  Rating->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Rating: rows
  Rating-->>C: result
  C->>Rating: projectRatingExists()
  Rating->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Rating: rows
  Rating-->>C: result
  C->>Rating: save()
  Rating->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Rating: rows
  Rating-->>C: result
  C-->>B: RatingResponse
  B-->>UI: 201 Created JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end